    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=oxvc3bfa5k]{color:#707070} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=oxvc3bfa5k]{color:#8f8f8f}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h3 id=\"ConfigureDispositionConcepts-Description\">Description</h3><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Disposition is to enter the status of the patient like admit patient or discharge patient or transfer to another ward. All these should be &nbsp;concepts in OpenMRS (Example: Admit Patient should be a concept) .</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureDispositionConcepts-Steps\">Steps</h3><ol><li><strong>Create a concept Disposition</strong><br /><ul class=\"ul1\"><ul class=\"ul2\"><li class=\"li1\">Add new Concept with name Disposition.</li><li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Add concepts Admit Patient, Discharge Patient... concepts as coded answers to disposition concept set.</span></li><li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Add Mapping source as&nbsp;<strong>org.openmrs.module.emrapi&nbsp;</strong>and code as&nbsp;<strong>Disposition.</strong></span></li><li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Save the concept.</span></li></ul></ul><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Below screenshot displays an instance of the same</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/50921523/image2016-4-7%2014:15:23.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460018728102&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=490\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/50921523/image2016-4-7%2014:15:23.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460018728102&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921622\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2016-4-7 14:15:23.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"50921523\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"853907c0-afa4-4de0-951a-2e5993b6b366\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/50921523/image2016-4-7%2014:15:23.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460018728102&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=980 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/50921523/image2016-4-7%2014:15:23.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460018728102&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=490 1x\" /></span></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\"><br /></span></p></li><li><strong>Create a concept Disposition Notes(Optional):</strong><br /><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong> if some extra information is needed to added while entering disposition we can configure disposition notes concepts.<br /><ul class=\"ul1\"><ul class=\"ul2\"><li class=\"li1\">Add new Concept with name Disposition Note &nbsp;.</li><li class=\"li1\">Select data type as <strong>Text</strong>.</li><li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Add Mapping source as&nbsp;<strong>org.openmrs.module.emrapi&nbsp;</strong>and code as&nbsp;<strong>DispositionNote.</strong></span></li><li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Save the concept.</span></li></ul></ul><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Below screenshot displays an instance of the same</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=